WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:08.440
Shirogane... is not the Blue Knight...

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.190
<i>I will protect you.</i>

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.100
Shirogane?

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.060
Mmh?

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.170
Can I ask you something?

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:29.530
What is it?

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:35.510
I used to think that you were the Blue Knight,

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:40.220
but I’m wrong, right?
You’re not him...

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.720
True, I am not the Blue Knight.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.660
Are you disappointed?

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.690
No no, I knew it couldn’t be true.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.720
Sorry for saying something strange.
Never mind.

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:55.650
Ichigo…

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:57.740
Yes?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.740
It might all clear up soon.

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:24.270
Everytime I was in trouble, you appeared
to protect me – Blue Knight.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.980
Just who are you?

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.980
<i>I was born... only to protect you.</i>

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:36.630
I remember that feeling...

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.910
I feel like I know you.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:47.500
Anyway... Shirogane said I might find out
the truth soon. What did he mean?

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.920
You took a long bath.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:01.820
I was just thinking about something.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:05.540
Heh, you must have been thinking about Aoyama again!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.580
What makes you think that?

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:11.400
Well, Valentine’s Day is near.
You must be making lots of plans.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.440
Oh right, Valentine...

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:19.840
Don’t sulk like that. For you, I’ll...

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.640
Hey, not in front of the kid.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.240
But...

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.700
Ok... Ichigo, you can give chocolate to Aoyama.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:27.730
Good night.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.670
C’mon, don’t be shy!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:33.110
Chocolate, chocolate!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:39.480
Wow, this looks delicious!

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:41.770
I want to eat it!

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.930
Hmm, which kind of chocolate should I give to him?

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:53.150
Wait! I can’t make chocolate, can I?

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.610
A~ka~sa~ka~san!

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.140
What’s wrong? Are you hungry?

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:06.620
Yes yes, I’m hungry. No, that’s
not what I wanted to say!!!

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:12.290
Actually, can you teach me how to make chocolate?

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.860
Give it up, give it up.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:20.400
I wonder if chocolate made by Ichigo will be edible...

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.260
Who knows...

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.320
Hey, hey...!

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.570
Bu-Ling wants to eat it too!

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:26.530
Naturally!

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:28.870
I love to eat scary food!

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.410
What was that...?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.070
You’re all meanies!

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.480
I <i>can</i> make chocolate!

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.220
You can, Ichigo-san.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.490
With love, you can do anything.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.760
With love...

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:48.950
He’s right, Ichigo-san!
Give your best!

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:51.250
Yes, I will!

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:53.350
I say, give up!

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:56.110
I wonder if this will go well..

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.250
Who knows...

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.210
Akasaka-san, thank you for helping me!

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:06.680
Since it’s Valentine’s Day, I’d suggest sweet and meltingly soft milk chocolate.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:12.640
This time I’ll teach you how to make
strawberry milk chocolate.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.580
Wow, this looks yummy.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.440
Aoyama-kun will like this one, right?

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:21.160
Well then, please start.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.380
I have to do the dishes.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.560
Eh? You’re not helping...?

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:30.830
I’ll explain how to make it, but it’s pointless
if you don’t make it yourself, Ichigo-san.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:35.320
Yes, Akasaka-san is right!

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.590
Alright!! I’ll give my best!!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:46.360
Oops! Where’s the towel?! Oh, no!

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.220
Ichigo-san, calm down.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.580
I thought Ichigo-san was making chocolate, but…

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.380
<i>Uh-oh, I added too much...</i>

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.090
What’s with that explosion...?

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:04.950
Even if she manages to finish it,
please do not ask me to taste it.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.640
I’m looking forward to it!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.910
Oh, it became quiet.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:19.430
Akasaka-san, this is what I made, but...

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:24.070
Strange... I can’t even guess what mistakes you-made.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:27.200
What is this muddled object?!

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.120
You call this chocolate?

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.780
Looks yummy!!

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.100
Doesn’t it? Try tasting it!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.880
Let’s eat!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.030
Not even Bu-Ling can eat it...

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.720
Ichigo-san, did you measure the ingredients properly?

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.340
I did,

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:53.640
but since I’m giving it to Aoyama-kun,
I couldn’t help but to add extra.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:57.400
You can’t just add more. You have
to do as the recipe says.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.550
I wonder if it is impossible for me after all...?

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:07.120
I thought I would give him handmade chocolate the first time in my life, but...

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.510
Don’t be so down.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:16.790
But... Aoyama-kun wouldn’t want weird
chocolate like this either, would he?

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.560
Ichigo-san, what’s more important than the looks

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.650
...are the feelings that you put into your chocolate.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:29.520
If your efforts reach him,
I’m sure he will respond.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.120
Akasaka-san!

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:34.690
Chocolate is such a magical candy.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:36.080
Yes!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:40.730
Bu-Ling wants to make chocolate for her little brothers too!

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.230
Let’s do it together, Ok?!

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.540
Yes, let’s!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:48.380
Now that I think about it...
Oniisama likes chocolate too.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:51.160
Who would I give chocolate to...

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.000
<i>Yes, Aoyama.</i>

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.880
Hello, Aoyama-kun.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.200
<i>Ichigo, what’s up?</i>

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:14.070
Um, if it’s alright with you, maybe
we could meet next Sunday?

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:17.060
<i>“If it’s alright?” Sure it is!</i>

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:18.650
<i>We’ll meet there as usual?</i>

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:22.020
Yes, I’m looking forward to it!!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.240
See you then!

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:24.730
<i>Ichigo...</i>

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.110
What is it?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.110
<i>Umm...</i>

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:29.160
What’s wrong, Aoyama-kun?

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.390
<i>Actually, lately I’ve been
worried about you.</i>

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:40.960
<i>If possible, I wish you wouldn’t fight anymore.</i>

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:45.840
Why? Aoyama-kun always backed me up, but...

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.840
<i>I’m sorry for saying weird things all of a sudden.</i>

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.720
<i>I guess I’m worrying too much.</i>

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:58.490
No no... I’m fine, really!
I’m the strongest ally of justice after all!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.430
So, see you Sunday!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:02.140
<i>Um, byebye.</i>

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.110
Byebye.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:09.460
Aoyama-kun, I’m sorry for worrying you.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:15.340
I really don’t want you to worry.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:20.410
I want you to always be
happy and smiling.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:26.400
I hope, Aoyama-kun will be happy
when he gets this chocolate...

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:34.410
Ichigo-san, your thoughts surely will reach him.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:48.790
Aoyama-kun, the chocolate is done.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:53.760
The shape is awkward, but it’s the first
time in my life that I’ve done this.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.930
Hey, kitty!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.690
This is where we first met, isn’t it?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.540
You’ve gained a little weight, huh?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:24.350
Don’t!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.210
You’re always so aggressive.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:29.880
What did you come here for?

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.590
W-What?

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.990
I came to pick you up.

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.230
Too bad... Let’s go, Ichigo.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.190
No!

00:09:53.880 --> 00:10:00.660
Come on already. Even if you say “no”,
I’m taking you. I’ve already decided.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.580
She’s late.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:24.030
I came all the way to pick you up,
so come with me.

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:28.560
NO! I have an important date!
I don’t have time for this!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:34.110
I won’t forgive you disobeying me.
I <i>will </i> take you with me.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:46.290
What’s this uneasy feeling?
Ichigo, did something happen?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:51.920
Come with me, Ichigo.
Let’s go... Come on.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.820
No!

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:57.200
Why won’t you do as I say?

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.890
Just why should I obey you?

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.600
“Why”...?

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.350
Ichigo...

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:10.960
I went through the trouble of coming to
pick you up... Now come with me...

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.980
Just the two of us... To a world with nobody else, and without fighting.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.940
Huh? What? What are you talking about, Quiche?

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:23.850
This is the way.
This is the only option.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:27.120
I don’t understand,
I don’t get what you mean!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:28.790
Let’s go.

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:36.000
Don’t be stubborn.
I know you’ll understand.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:38.700
You’ll come with me, right?

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:44.180
I said this much, and you still don’t understand?!

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:48.580
Come! Come already, Ichigo!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.640
I can’t! I can’t do that, Quiche!

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.310
I want to go see Aoyama-kun!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.940
He is the only one for me.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:06.850
Ichigo, you’re still thinking about that human?

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.450
So you won’t come with me no matter what?

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:14.420
If you don’t come, I’ll kill you!

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:17.600
Ichigo!

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:19.800
Here I go, Ichigo.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.660
Ichigo!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.870
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO–

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.790
I’ll keep this for a while.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:13:00.860
I wonder if Ichigo-san has already given
the chocolate to Aoyama-kun...

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:05.720
I feel sorry for Aoyama-san. He has to
eat Ichigo’s homemade chocolate.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:11.180
Everyone! The energy of a Mew Mew
transforming was detected.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.420
It’s Ichigo-san’s!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.790
But, oddly enough, the signal disappeared a moment later.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:22.400
It’s possible that she was attacked or interrupted while transforming.

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.060
Shirogane.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.590
Everyone, let’s go! Ichigo’s in danger.

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:28.770
Yes!

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.520
Keiichirou, keep researching the matter.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.610
Understood.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:39.440
I like the way you look when you’re willed to win...

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.050
but your frightened face is even prettier, Ichigo.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:46.410
It’s not too late to change your mind.

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.910
Come with me and I’ll save you.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.680
I don’t want to kill you.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.730
Ow. I’ve sprained my foot.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:01.300
You’re so stubborn... That’s too bad.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.150
Ichigo!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:11.850
Aoyama-kun!

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:14.270
Here comes the bother...

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.750
Aoyama-kun, run away!
It’s dangerous!

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:21.820
Ichigo, I won’t run away.

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:24.460
I didn’t come here to run away.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.530
But...

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.990
If that’s what you want, I’ll send you...

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:30.660
down to hell!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:34.670
Quiche, stop! Aoyama-kun, please run away!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:40.770
I don’t know why, but I’m not scared.
I want to protect you, Ichigo.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:44.320
SHUT UP! Ichigo is MINE!

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:44.980
Run!

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.300
Aoyama-kun!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.150
Darn it!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.080
<i>Yes, I am...</i>

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:04.380
Ichigo, I am... I am...

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:22.480
I am the one who was born only to protect thee.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:27.440
A-Aoyama-kun is...

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.720
I won’t forgive anyone who tries to hurt Ichigo.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.510
I’ll protect her even at the cost of my life.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:36.350
How come all you do is bother me!

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.000
Why are you stealing
everything from me?

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.280
Don’t look at me like that!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.610
If only you didn’t exist... If only!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.130
I’ll never forgive you!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.540
What’s wrong, Blue Knight?

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.480
Was he hurt by that explosion a little while ago?

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.060
I will take Ichigo with me!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.570
I won’t let you.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.770
Ichigo!

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.000
Are you alright?

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:22.160
Everyone!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.440
That’s the Blue Knight.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:27.170
It looks like Quiche got beaten.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:32.650
Not yet... I’m not defeated yet.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.260
ICHIGO IS MINE!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.310
AOYAMA-KUN!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.210
Aoyama-kun...?

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:46.460
She certainly called the Blue Knight Aoyama-kun...

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.260
What does that mean?

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:49.390
Let’s go help them!

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:50.030
Wait!

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:58.770
If Ichigo doesn’t come with me, I have
no choice but die here with her.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.520
But before that...

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.700
YOU DIE!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.130
Stop it, Quiche!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:10.630
Let go!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.070
Stop it! Please!

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:14.470
Don’t get in my way!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.620
Now to finish it...

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.020
DIE, Blue Knight!

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.400
Ichigo!

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.190
Ichigo...

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:45.390
Look!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:46.290
That’s...

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.540
Ichigo!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:07.390
Please don’t kill... the most important person to me.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:11.110
Ichigo. Are you crying?

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:19.030
Quiche, I won’t come...
I can’t go with you.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:31.610
Alright, Ichigo...

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:34.250
Then l’ll go alone.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:39.830
I guess I went round and round and got nowhere.

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.220
Uncool, huh?

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.920
<i>Ichigo, byebye.</i>

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.650
Ichigo, thank you for saving me.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.800
Aoyama-kun...

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.120
I surprised you, didn’t I?

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:06.110
I surprised myself.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.820
I never imagined you were the Blue Knight...

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.940
Ichigo, what’s wrong?

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:18.090
No, nothing.

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:19.180
Here.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.660
It’s not perfect, but it’s the first time in my life that I’ve made chocolate on my own.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.490
Thanks, Ichigo!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:27.560
Ah, I’ll open it!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:34.130
I know this doesn’t look very beautiful,
but it’s the best one.

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.210
Say “aah.”

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.140
Aah.

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:41.260
Mhh, tasty! It tastes like strawberries!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.990
Really? Thank goodness!

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:50.480
Aoyama-kun, you’ve always protected me
no matter when or where...

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:52.400
I couldn’t be happier.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:05.760
The Blue Knight... What exactly is he?

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:13.380
Aoyama-kun, I’ll send you this message
along with the chocolate.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.800
“Thank you.”

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:21.350
I loved you, I love you, and
I will love you forever.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:28.210
What a surprise! Ichigo’s boyfriend is the Blue Knight?!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.210
I’m soooo happy!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:34.550
You feel secure knowing that
he’s always by you, don’t you?

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:39.220
From now on, I can always be with Aoyama-kun even during fights!

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.370
I’m so happy!

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:44.980
Hey, no making out with your boyfriend during fights!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:48.980
Next: “New Reinforcement:
Protect the Earth Together”

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:50.980
Minto, did you say something?

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:54.070
This is worrying me...
